  "patthana12.10:1.1": "dhammaṃ paṭicca .. ",
  "patthana12.10:2.1": "na ",
  "patthana12.10:3.1": "bāhiraṃ na hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ... ",
  "patthana12.10:4.1": "na ",
  "patthana12.10:5.1": "upādā na hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ... na upādinnaṃ na hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca .. ",
  "patthana12.10:6.1": "na ",
  "patthana12.10:7.1": "anupādinnaṃ na hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ... ",
  "patthana12.10:8.1": "dvigocchakaduka nahetudukaṃ no ",
  "patthana12.10:9.1": "upādānaṃ na hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ... no ",
  "patthana12.10:10.1": "kilesaṃ na hetuṃ "
